Project Testing Phase
Test the application systematically.
Unit Testing — Test individual functions/modules.
Integration Testing — Test communication between modules.
System Testing — Test the complete application.
UI Testing — Check usability and responsiveness.
AI Testing — Evaluate recommendation accuracy and relevance.
Security Testing — Check authentication and data protection.
Performance Testing — Check response time and stability.
User Acceptance Testing — Collect feedback from intended users.
Fix identified bugs and perform regression testing.

